  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">LWF IAP Agriculture</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">LWF IOP Jordbruk</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet inkluderar utbildning av utvalda och motiverade sm&#xE5;skaliga b&#xF6;nder i intensivt, marknadsorienterat jordbruk, tillhandah&#xE5;llande av paket f&#xF6;r jordbruksresurser samt uppmuntran till bildande av jordbruksf&#xF6;reningar p&#xE5; byniv&#xE5; som skall s&#xF6;ka marknader f&#xF6;r h&#xF6;gkvalitativa jordbruksprodukter. St&#xF6;det sker till stor del parallellt till Sidas Integrerade Omr&#xE5;desprogram i Bosnien.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program includes training of selected and motivated small-scale farmers in intensive, market oriented agriculture, supply of kits of agriculture resources as well as encouragement of village agricultural associations that will seek markets for high-quality agricultural products. The support is to a high degree implemented in parallell with the Integrated Area Programs in Bosnia-Herzegovina.</narrative>
  </description>
